Appendix B — Cryptographic Protocols (Pseudocode)

B.1 Daily Consolidation and Ghost Backup Protocol

```
PROTOCOL DailyConsolidation(robot, blackbox, ghost_endpoints)

  // Phase 1: Prepare
  entries ← robot.transient_buffer.get_since(last_consolidation)
  classified ← MemoryClassifier.apply(entries)
  compressed ← DeltaEncodeAndCompress(classified)

  // Phase 2: Encrypt and sign
  for each category c in classified:
    K_cat ← HKDF(K_master, salt_c, "category:" || c.id || version)
    for each entry e in classified[c]:
      nonce ← EncodeUint96(e.seq) || 0x00   // direction: robot→BB
      E ← AES-256-GCM(K_cat, e, nonce)
      σ ← Ed25519.Sign(K_session, SHA3-256(E || e.seq))
      packet.append(c.id, E, σ, e.seq)

  // Phase 3: Transmit over isolated local channel
  Send(packet) over USB-C / mTLS VLAN → blackbox

  // Phase 4: Verify and commit
  for each (c.id, E, σ, seq) in packet:
    Verify(robot_public_key, σ, SHA3-256(E || seq))
    Assert(seq == blackbox.journal.tail + 1)
    blackbox.balloon.append(c.id, E, seq, timestamp)
  receipt ← blackbox.balloon.get_commitment()

  // Phase 5: Ghost Backup
  new_entries ← blackbox.journal.entries_since(last_ghost_marker)
  backup_bundle ← Serialize(new_entries)
  K_backup ← HKDF(K_master, "ghost_backup", version)
  nonce_ghost ← EncodeUint96(ghost_counter) || 0x01  // direction: BB→Ghost
  E_backup ← AES-256-GCM(K_backup, backup_bundle, nonce_ghost)

  // Shamir (3,5) sharding
  shares ← ShamirShare(E_backup, t=3, n=5, field=GF(2^256+...))
  for i = 1 to 5:
    K_transport ← HKDF(K_backup, "transport:" || i, epoch_nonce)
    nonce_share ← EncodeUint96(share_counter_i) || 0x01
    blob ← AES-256-GCM(K_transport, shares[i], nonce_share)
    Upload(blob) to ghost_endpoints[i]

  // Phase 6: Purge
  robot.transient_buffer.delete(entries)
  robot.store_anonymized_embeddings_only(compressed.semantic_summaries)
  last_consolidation_time ← now
  ghost_counter ← ghost_counter + 1
```

B.2 Ghost Reconstruction Protocol

```
PROTOCOL GhostReconstruct(ghost_endpoints, K_backup)

  blobs ← []
  for i = 1 to 5:
    blob_i ← Download(ghost_endpoints[i])
    K_transport ← HKDF(K_backup, "transport:" || i, epoch_nonce)
    nonce_share ← EncodeUint96(share_counter_i) || 0x01
    share_i ← AES-256-GCM-Decrypt(K_transport, blob_i, nonce_share)
    blobs.append(share_i)

  // Select any 3 valid shares
  E_backup ← ShamirReconstruct(blobs[0..2], t=3, field=GF(2^256+...))
  backup_bundle ← AES-256-GCM-Decrypt(K_backup, E_backup, ghost_nonce)
  new_blackbox.ingest_journal(backup_bundle)
```

